atlas optimization-design-lineage

architecture architecture-claim
  canonical_name ArchitectureClaim
  owns ClaimIdentity
  owns ClaimStatus
  owns VerificationState
  consumes Measurement
  consumes AnalysisUniverse
  publishes ClaimStatus
  publishes DesignLineage
  family optimization
  domain Optimization / Design lineage
  layer governance
  semantic_question Where did this architectural claim come from, what evidence stands behind it now, and what would falsify it?
  purpose Stop managing architecture by latest-document-wins. A claim carries its origin, its reason, its evidence, its measurements and the universe those measurements were taken under, so a correction revises a claim rather than silently replacing a whole design.
  maturity architectural
  node_types ArchitectureClaim
  node_types DesignLineage
  node_types Correction
  node_types VerificationState
  edge_types supersedes
  edge_types contradicts
  edge_types corrects
  edge_types depends_on
  edge_types evidenced_by
  invariant a claim carries its origin, original reason, semantic scope and blast radius
  invariant a claim carries a verification state distinct from its implementation state and its proof state
  invariant a newer document does not supersede an older claim; only evidence or an explicit supersession does
  invariant a correction revises the claim it targets and leaves the lineage intact; retraction is recorded, never deleted
  invariant a local success never silently shrinks a larger design; narrowing scope is itself a claim requiring evidence
  invariant a claim derived from a document is VERIFIED only when something on disk or a measurement confirms it
  invariant an inventory recovered from a design document is ASSERTED until independently checked, however authoritative the document
  forbidden_inference the most recent summary -> the current architecture
  forbidden_inference a claim being long-standing -> that claim being verified
  forbidden_inference a claim being unverified -> that claim being wrong
  forbidden_inference a proving workload succeeding -> the wider machine being reducible to it
  forbidden_inference absence from a recent summary -> removal from the design
  interacts readiness-state
  interacts analysis-universe
  interacts optimization-proof
  source_lineage Generation-10 no-prune recovery, 2026-08-26

